# Pollenreach Spit (CIPlay pollenreach_spit): the skiff beach at 1.2 m round 0 -46.8, the shelter at -16.2 -48.6, the
# mast locker at 13.5 -42.3, three pollen jars on the dunes, the leaflet board on the dune top at 3.6 25.2.
island Pollenreach Spit
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -21.5; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 21.5
expect step 0
expect title The Pollen Trail
zone skiff
expect step 1
read Skiff log: following the pollen
expect step 2
open Skiff cabin
wait 3
expect step 3
use pollen1
use pollen2
use pollen3
expect story pollen 3
expect step 4
use samplecase
expect story pollen 0
expect step 5
open Mast locker
wait 3
expect step 6
read Seedkeepers' leaflet
expect done
